OL,3,GNEWSACouncil explores handing Market
OL,4,AHall to operator
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council is exploring the
OL,7,Fpossibility of handing the Market Hall
OL,8,Fover to a private operator amid a
OL,9,Fdisappointing financial forecast.
OL,11,FThe venue reopened in May 2025
OL,12,Ffollowing a #35m restoration project.
OL,13,FHowever, a council financial report for
OL,14,Fthe first quarter of 2026-27 forecasts
OL,15,Fa #338,000 deficit due to what
OL,16,Fofficials described as a "shortfall of
OL,17,Ftrader income".
OL,19,FCouncil leader Nadine Peatfield told
OL,20,Fthe BBC her cabinet would meet in
OL,21,FOctober to discuss the next steps.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
